Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.55,0:20:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}守備力1600の\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备力1600的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}ｽｶﾙ･ｸﾗｰｹﾝ｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骷髅乌贼。
